-Sentry is added to this app in `labs/04-slack-agent.md`.
+## Sentry
+
+Set `SENTRY_DSN` in `.env.local` (`SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT` and `SENTRY_RELEASE`
+are optional). Each handled Slack message becomes one trace: a `slack.message`
+transaction tagged with the Slack channel and the thread timestamp as the
+conversation id, with the model call and its tool calls nested inside as
+`gen_ai` spans, and Postgres queries from `lib/db` as `db.query` spans. The
+Sentry user is the Slack user who sent the message. Errors and the bot's own
+log lines go to Sentry too.
